uced by Londinium's factories, not yet sent to the assembly line. Unsafe to hold before assembly, but still more threatening than empty hands.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","Operators equipped with this gain increased ATK","When equipped by enemies","Units equipped with this gain increased ATK","Obtains a Barrier","Gear is lost when Barrier is broken"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"neighborhood_watch_member":{"slug":"neighborhood_watch_member","name":"'Neighborhood Watch' Member","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Neighborhood Watch' Member.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A member of an illegal organization formed by citizens to defend their neighborhood by any means. They often wear fake mustaches to appear seasoned and scare off perps without violence.","abilities":["Can equip gear, max 1","When equipped with gear, DEF increases","After several attacks, charges up for a splash damage attack"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":900,"def":1100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"assault_arts_unit":{"slug":"assault_arts_unit","name":"Assault Arts Unit","icon":"/enemies-icons/Assault Arts Unit.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Standard-issue staff components produced by Londinium's factories, not yet sent to the assembly line. Often malfunctions, but better than letting an Infected cast Arts with their bare hands.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","For a short time after activating their skills, Operators equipped with this deal additional Arts damage and inflict Frighten for a fixed duration when dealing